# PostHog product analytics (cookieless). Both values are optional: the project's public,
# write-only key and the US Cloud host are built in (src/analytics/config.ts). Uncomment to
# override at build time (NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the bundle).

# Project API key (phc_...). Set it to an empty value to switch analytics off completely.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=

# Ingestion host: https://us.i.posthog.com (default) or https://eu.i.posthog.com.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=
